      "accessed": "2026-11-24",
      "note": "727-200 N275WC, left side, in sun, January 1987: the same scheme still worn; the blue running on up into the tailplane fairing's aft end, the pewter line under the fin's title."
    },
    {
      "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Braniff_(1983%E2%80%931990)",
      "title": "Braniff (1983–1990), Wikipedia",
      "accessed": "2026-11-24",
      "note": "Evidence only: service began 1 March 1984 with 727-200s from Dallas/Fort Worth; scheduled flights ended 6 November 1989; the launch scheme (white over dark blue, a pewter-silver cheatline, red titles angled up the tail) kept into the late 1980s; 737-200s from 1987, BAC One-Elevens from 1988, A320s from 1989."
    }
